{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-1","title":"1 Peter 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He exhorts them from the breach of charity; 4 shewing that Christ is the foundation whereupon they are built. 11 He beseeches them also to abstain from fleshly lusts; 13 to be obedient to magistrates; 18 and teaches servants how to obey their masters; 20 patiently suffering for well doing, after the example of Christ.</p>\n<p>Wherefore. 1:18-25 laying. 4:2; Isa 2:20; 30:22; Eze 18:31,32; Ro 13:12; Eph 4:22-25; Col 3:5-8 Heb 12:1; Jas 1:21; 5:9 malice. 16; 1Co 5:8; 14:20; Eph 4:31; Tit 3:3-5 guile. 22; 3:10; Ps 32:2; 34:13; Joh 1:47; 1Th 2:3; Re 14:5 hypocrisies. Job 36:13; Mt 7:5; 15:7; 23:28; 24:51; Mr 12:15; Lu 6:42; 11:44; 12:1 Jas 3:17 envies. 1Sa 18:8,9; Ps 37:1; 73:3; Pr 3:31; 14:30; 24:1,19; Ro 1:29; 13:13 1Co 3:2,3; 2Co 12:20; Ga 5:21-26; Jas 3:14,16; 4:5 all evils. 4:4; Eph 4:31; Col 3:8; 1Ti 3:11; Tit 2:3; Jas 4:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-2","title":"1 Peter 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>new-born. 1:23; Mt 18:3; Mr 10:15; Ro 6:4; 1Co 3:1; 14:20 the sincere. Ps 19:7-10; 1Co 3:2; Heb 5:12,13 grow. 2Sa 23:5; Job 17:9; Pr 4:18; Ho 6:3; 14:5,7; Mal 4:2; Eph 2:21; 4:15 2Th 1:3; 2Pe 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-3","title":"1 Peter 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Ps 9:10; 24:8; 63:5; So 2:3; Zec 9:17; Heb 6:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-4","title":"1 Peter 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>To. Isa 55:3; Jer 3:22; Mt 11:28; Joh 5:40; 6:37 a living. Joh 5:26; 6:57; 11:25,26; 14:6,19; Ro 5:10; Col 3:4 stone. Isa 28:16; Da 2:34,45; Zec 3:9; 4:7 disallowed. Ps 118:22,23; Isa 8:14,15; Mt 21:42; Mr 12:10,11; Lu 20:17,18 Ac 4:11,12 chosen. Isa 42:1; Mt 12:18 precious. 7; 1:7,19; 2Pe 1:1,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-5","title":"1 Peter 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>also. 1Co 3:16; 6:19; 2Co 6:16; Eph 2:20-22; Heb 3:6; Re 3:12 are built. or, be ye built. an holy. 9; Isa 61:6; 66:21; Re 1:6; 5:10; 20:6 spiritual. Ps 50:14,23; 141:2; Ho 14:2; Mal 1:11; Joh 4:22-24; Ro 12:1 Php 2:17; 4:18; Heb 13:15,16 acceptable. 4:11; Php 1:11; 4:18; Col 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-6","title":"1 Peter 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>it. Da 10:21; Mr 12:10; Joh 7:38; Ac 1:16; 2Ti 3:16; 2Pe 1:20; 3:16 Behold. 4; Isa 28:16; Zec 10:4; Ro 9:32,33; Eph 2:20 elect. Ps 89:19; Isa 42:1; Mt 12:18; Lu 23:35; Eph 1:4 shall. Ps 40:14; Isa 41:11; 45:16,17; 50:7; 54:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-7","title":"1 Peter 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>you. 1:8; So 5:9-16; Hag 2:7; Mt 13:44-46; Joh 4:42; 6:68,69; Php 3:7-10 precious. or, an honour. Isa 28:5; Lu 2:32 which be. 8; Ac 26:19; Ro 10:21; 15:31; *marg: Tit 3:3; Heb 4:11; 11:31; *marg: the stone. Ps 118:22,23; Mt 21:42; Mr 12:10,11; Lu 20:17; Ac 4:11,12 the head. Zec 4:7; Col 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-8","title":"1 Peter 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>a stone. Isa 8:14; 57:14; Lu 2:34; Ro 9:32,33; 1Co 1:23; 2Co 2:16 being. 7 whereunto. Ex 9:16; Ro 9:22; 1Th 5:9; 2Pe 2:3; Jude 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-9","title":"1 Peter 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>a chosen. 1:2; De 10:15; Ps 22:30; 33:12; 73