o 13:1-7 Eph 5:21; 1Ti 2:1,2; Tit 3:1; 2Pe 2:10; Jude 1:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-14","title":"1 Peter 2:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>for the punishment. Ro 13:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-15","title":"1 Peter 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>so. 4:2; Eph 6:6,7; 1Th 4:3; 5:18 with. 12; Job 5:16; Ps 107:42; Tit 2:8 the ignorance. 1Ti 1:13; 2Pe 2:12; Jude 1:10 foolish. De 32:6; Job 2:10; Ps 5:5; Pr 9:6; Jer 4:22; Mt 7:26; 25:2; Ro 1:21 Ga 3:1; Tit 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-16","title":"1 Peter 2:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>free. Joh 8:32-36; Ro 6:18,22; 1Co 7:22; Ga 5:1,13; Jas 1:25; 2:12 2Pe 2:19 and. Jude 1:4 using. Gr. having. a cloke. Mt 23:14; Joh 15:22; 1Th 2:5 but. Eph 6:6; Col 3:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-17","title":"1 Peter 2:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Honour. or, Esteem. 5:5; Ex 20:12; Le 19:32; 1Sa 15:30; Ro 12:10; 13:7; Php 2:3; 1Ti 6:1 Love. 1:22; Joh 13:35; Heb 13:1; Zec 11:14 Fear. Ge 20:11; 22:12; 42:18; Ps 111:10; Pr 1:7; 23:17; 24:21; Ec 8:2 Mt 22:21; Ro 13:7; 2Co 7:1; Eph 5:21 Honour. 1Sa 15:30; 1Ch 29:20; Pr 24:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-18","title":"1 Peter 2:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>be. Eph 6:5-7; Col 3:22-25; 1Ti 6:1-3; Tit 2:9,10 the good. 2Co 10:1; Ga 5:22; Tit 3:2; Jas 3:17 but. Ps 101:4; Pr 3:32; 8:13; 10:32; 11:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-19","title":"1 Peter 2:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>this. 20; Lu 6:32 thankworthy. or, thank. Ac 11:23; 1Co 15:10; 2Co 1:12; 8:1; *Gr: for conscience. 3:14-17; Mt 5:10-12; Joh 15:21; Ro 13:5; 2Ti 1:12 suffering. Job 21:27; Ps 35:19; 38:19; 69:4; 119:86</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-20","title":"1 Peter 2:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>For. 3:14; 4:14-16; Mt 5:47 buffeted. Mt 26:67; Mr 14:65; 1Co 4:11 when. 19 this. Mt 5:10-12; Ro 12:1,2; Eph 5:10; Php 4:18 acceptable. or, thank. 19; Lu 6:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-21","title":"1 Peter 2:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>even. Mt 10:38; 16:24; Mr 8:34,35; Lu 9:23-25; 14:26,27; Joh 16:33 Ac 9:16; 14:22; 1Th 3:3; 4:2; 2Ti 3:12 because. 24; 3:18; 4:1; Lu 24:26; Ac 17:3; Heb 2:10 for us.Some read, for you.</p>\n<p>1:20 leaving. Ps 85:13; Joh 13:15; Ro 8:29; 1Co 11:1; Eph 5:2; Php 2:5; 1Jo 2:6 1Jo 3:16; Re 12:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-22","title":"1 Peter 2:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>did. Isa 53:9; Mt 27:4,19,23,24; Lu 23:41,47; Joh 8:46; 2Co 5:21 Heb 4:15; 7:26,27; 9:28; 1Jo 2:1; 3:5 guile. Joh 1:47; Re 14:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-23","title":"1 Peter 2:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>when he was. Ps 38:12-14; Isa 53:7; Mt 27:39-44; Mr 14:60,61; 15:29-32 Lu 22:64,65; 23:9,34-39; Joh 8:48,49; 19:9-11; Ac 8:32-35; Heb 12:3 threatened. Ac 4:29; 9:1; Eph 6:9 but. 4:19; Ps 10:14; 31:5; 37:5; Lu 23:46; Ac 7:59; 2Ti 1:12 himself. or, his cause. judgeth. Ge 18:25; Ps 7:11; 96:13; Ac 17:31; Ro 2:5; 2Th 1:5; 2Ti 4:8 Re 19:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-24","title":"1 Peter 2:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>his own self. Ex 28:38; Le 16:22; 22:9; Nu 18:22; Ps 38:4; Isa 53:4-6,11; Mt 8:17 Joh 1:29; Heb 9:28 on. or, to. the tree. De 21:22,23; Ac 5:30; 10:39; 13:29; Ga 3:13 being. 4:1,2; Ro 6:2,7,11; 7:6; *marg: Col 2:20; 3:3; *Gr: 2Co 6:17; Heb 7:26 live. Mt 5:20; Lu 1:74,75; Ac 10:35; Ro 6:11,16,22; Eph 5:9; Php 1:11 1Jo 2:29; 3:7 by. Isa 53:5,6; Mt 27:26; Mr 15:15; Joh 19:1 healed. Ps 147:3; Mal 4:2; Lu 4:18; Re 22:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1pe-2-25","title":"1 Peter 2:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1PE","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>ye. Ps 119:176; Isa 53:6; Jer 23:2; Eze 34:6; Mt 9:36; 18:12; Lu 15:4-6 the Shepherd. 5:4; Ps 23:1-3; 80:1; So 1:7,8; Isa 40:11; Eze 34:11-16,23,24; 37:24 Zec 13:7; Joh 10:11-16; Heb 13:20 Bishop. Heb 3:1; Ac 20:28; *Gr:</p>"}]}